on the maps in the binder.


00:12:34.687 --> 00:12:36.422
Yeah, I recognise them.


00:12:36.423 --> 00:12:39.758
This is Trie Phong,
right in our own backyard.


00:12:39.759 --> 00:12:41.994
Well, it seems we have a map


00:12:41.995 --> 00:12:44.464
